stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /streams/:streamId/comments
  body: { content: string, userId: string }
  → 201 { id, videoId, userId, content, createdAt }

GET /streams/:streamId/comments?limit=1000
  → 200 Comment[]

WS /streams/:streamId/comments/live
  → on new comment: { type: 'comment', data: { id, userId, content, createdAt } }
